+# Wire serialisation format
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation) for internal message serialisation. CBOR was chosen because it preserves type information better across protocol versions, which improves forward and backward compatibility in message handling as protocol schemas evolve.
